@startuml

participant User
participant Client
participant Controller
participant Service
participant Mapper
database Database
participant Filesystem

User -> Client: 发送上传文件请求
Client -> Controller: 上传文件请求
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: 调用上传文件方法
activate Service
Service -> Filesystem: 保存文件至文件系统
activate Filesystem
Filesystem --> Service: 返回文件保存路径和下载token
Service --> Controller: 返回文件保存路径和下载token
deactivate Filesystem
Controller --> Client: 返回文件保存路径和下载token
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
User <- Client: 收到文件保存路径和下载token

User -> Client: 输入图书基本信息
Client -> Controller: 发送保存图书请求
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: 调用保存图书方法
activate Service
Service -> Mapper: 获取图书分类信息
activate Mapper
Mapper -> Database: 查询图书分类信息
activate Database
Database --> Mapper: 返回图书分类信息
deactivate Database
Mapper --> Service: 返回图书分类信息
deactivate Mapper
Service -> Service: 处理图书分类信息
Service -> Mapper: 保存图书信息
activate Mapper
Mapper -> Database: 插入图书信息
activate Database
Database --> Mapper: 返回插入结果
deactivate Database
Mapper --> Service: 返回插入结果
deactivate Mapper
Service --> Controller: 返回插入结果
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
Controller --> Client: 返回插入结果

@enduml
